# Files infra/scripts/no-binaries.py lets through. One fnmatch pattern per line, matched against the path relative to
# the repository being committed (staged) and against the path from the project root (tree); `*` crosses `/`.
# `size:` allows only the size: an executable binary is refused anyway. Add a line only for content that must be
# committed, with the reason.
size:*/fonts/*.otf                        # infra/print: Noto Sans SC, part of each template version (8.3-8.5 MB)
size:dev/rebuild/experiment-data/*        # raw experiment output kept on purpose (logs up to 12.9 MB)
